        <briefdescription>
<para>Create a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_dynamic_library_search_generator" kindref="compound">DynamicLibrarySearchGenerator</ref> that searches for symbols in the given <ref refid="classllvm_1_1sys_1_1_dynamic_library" kindref="compound">sys::DynamicLibrary</ref>. </para>
