    <briefdescription>
<para>A utility class to expose symbols found via dlsym to the JIT. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>If an instance of this class is attached to a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_j_i_t_dylib" kindref="compound">JITDylib</ref> as a fallback definition generator, then any symbol found in the given <ref refid="classllvm_1_1sys_1_1_dynamic_library" kindref="compound">DynamicLibrary</ref> that passes the &apos;Allow&apos; predicate will be added to the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1orc_1_1_j_i_t_dylib" kindref="compound">JITDylib</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
